From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] journal: make Escape leave the GTK4 detail view

The GTK4 Journal already documents Escape as search cancellation and detail
navigation.  The detail branch handled Left but not Escape, leaving the detail
canvas active while shell-level navigation re-entered Journal.  Route Escape
through the existing main-view transition so the action is immediate and
idempotent.

--- a/src/jarabe/journal/journalactivity.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/journal/journalactivity.py
@@ -425,3 +425,7 @@
         elif self._active_view == JournalViews.DETAIL:
+            if keyname == 'Escape':
+                self.show_main_view()
+                return True
+
             if keyname == 'Left':
                 path, col = self._list_view.tree_view.get_cursor()
